    source: https://www.bd.com/en-us/products-and-solutions/products/product-page.248200
    notes: TOGO M2851 uses1L prepared Difco Bordet-Gengou basal agar before a separate15%
      defibrinated horse-blood addition. BD248200 corroborates the named dehydrated
      product; it does not identify that litre as dry powder or establish the historical
      preparation recipe. This dry-product candidate is product context only for M2851.
      Exact preparation equivalence to DSMZ438 is unresolved because M2851 provides
      no basal formula, stock concentration or original-source bridge. No procurement
      state, dilution quantity, new global alias or source-to-owner exact identity
      is inferred.
